1323
00:46:37,294 --> 00:46:39,364
- I see it everywhere. - True.

1324
00:46:39,734 --> 00:46:42,234
Ho Yeon, was it two years ago?

1325
00:46:43,264 --> 00:46:44,803
I remember you telling me...

1326
00:46:44,804 --> 00:46:47,374
you were working out to be able to carry a gun.

1327
00:46:48,104 --> 00:46:50,174
Ho Yeon went through a lot. Here's why.

1328
00:46:50,444 --> 00:46:52,943
- The car Stellar is in the movie. - Yes, that car.

1329
00:46:52,944 --> 00:46:54,043
It's a really old one, no?

1330
00:46:54,044 --> 00:46:56,843
We asked around and bought every Stellar possible...

1331
00:46:56,844 --> 00:46:58,514
in the country.

1332
00:46:59,054 --> 00:47:00,054
You bought them?

1333
00:47:00,055 --> 00:47:01,553
One car wasn't enough.

1334
00:47:01,554 --> 00:47:03,124
There were 11 of them.

1335
00:47:04,084 --> 00:47:05,523
- All of them were manual. - Right.

1336
00:47:05,524 --> 00:47:06,624
All the Stellars were manual.

1337
00:47:06,954 --> 00:47:08,893
- Ho Yeon... - Did you get a license?

1338
00:47:08,894 --> 00:47:11,363
- Yes. - I only had a regular license.

1339
00:47:11,364 --> 00:47:13,363
- So I got the manual one. - She got another license.

1340
00:47:13,364 --> 00:47:14,564
Getting one is hard now.

1341
00:47:15,364 --> 00:47:16,533
(After getting her license,)

1342
00:47:16,534 --> 00:47:18,474
(she mastered high-difficulty driving herself...)

1343
00:47:20,234 --> 00:47:23,274
(and boldly performed the intense driving scenes.)

1344
00:47:24,444 --> 00:47:27,614
(High-level action scenes that took a long time to bring to life)

1345
00:47:29,244 --> 00:47:31,784
