1346
00:47:34,054 --> 00:47:35,154
The Crocodile Game.

1347
00:47:36,024 --> 00:47:37,024
Shall we play it?

1348
00:47:37,025 --> 00:47:38,453
- No? - Should we?

1349
00:47:38,454 --> 00:47:40,254
You must really enjoy playing games.

1350
00:47:41,394 --> 00:47:43,193
There was a reason she was cast for "Squid Game."

1351
00:47:43,194 --> 00:47:44,394
You're right.

1352
00:47:44,764 --> 00:47:47,193
Ho Yeon is a big fan of games.

1353
00:47:47,194 --> 00:47:49,033
- I do love games. - "Squid Game" is about games.

1354
00:47:49,034 --> 00:47:51,164
She's a former gamer.

1355
