1356
00:47:53,434 --> 00:47:56,204
How about the one who gets bitten is out?

1357
00:47:56,504 --> 00:47:58,644
- Or the game will end too soon. - Okay.

1358
00:47:59,244 --> 00:48:00,643
- The order... - Go first, Ho Yeon.

1359
00:48:00,644 --> 00:48:01,784
- Got it. I'll go first. - Okay.

1360
00:48:02,884 --> 00:48:03,884
(Tapping)

1361
00:48:04,644 --> 00:48:05,654
(Tapping)

1362
00:48:05,854 --> 00:48:07,214
It's better to get bitten early.

1363
00:48:07,614 --> 00:48:08,924
- Only then are you out. - Right.

1364
00:48:09,624 --> 00:48:10,724
Bite me.

1365
00:48:13,224 --> 00:48:14,654
This feels about right.

1366
00:48:15,894 --> 00:48:17,024
- Okay. - Gosh.

1367
00:48:18,124 --> 00:48:19,534
Yes!

1368
00:48:20,894 --> 00:48:22,664
(Relieved)

1369
00:48:23,764 --> 00:48:24,903
- Okay. - Gosh.

1370
00:48:24,904 --> 00:48:25,934
(Disappointed)

1371
00:48:26,234 --> 00:48:27,534
Gosh. He made it.

1372
00:48:28,874 --> 00:48:30,173
Whoever gets bitten will get saved.

1373
00:48:30,174 --> 00:48:31,504
- When there are two left, - Okay.

1374
00:48:32,174 --> 00:48:33,674
- the bitten one will pay. - I got it.

1375
00:48:34,314 --> 00:48:36,113
- Why do you go first? - Aren't I the first one?

1376
00:48:36,114 --> 00:48:37,213
- Why do you go first? - Why?

1377
00:48:37,214 --> 00:48:38,413
The last game ended here.

1378
00:48:38,414 --> 00:48:39,853
- Let's play rock-paper-scissors. - Let's do that.

1379
00:48:39,854 --> 00:48:41,184
