1380
00:48:41,684 --> 00:48:42,724
I'll go first.

1381
00:48:43,584 --> 00:48:44,584
(Yeon Seok)

1382
00:48:44,585 --> 00:48:46,024
I need to make it out.

1383
00:48:47,224 --> 00:48:48,224
(Yeon Seok, Ho Yeon)

1384
00:48:48,694 --> 00:48:51,324
It's a good thing to get bitten, so we press it with ease.

1385
00:48:52,134 --> 00:48:53,134
(Yeon Seok)

1386
00:48:53,194 --> 00:48:54,194
(Ho Yeon)

1387
00:48:54,764 --> 00:48:56,664
I'm sorry. That was loud.

1388
00:48:57,534 --> 00:48:58,674
Is it just the two of us?

1389
00:48:59,574 --> 00:49:01,333
