1390
00:49:01,334 --> 00:49:04,844
- Now, the bitten one... - The bitten one will pay now.

1391
00:49:05,044 --> 00:49:07,274
But it's okay to push more than one tooth.

1392
00:49:07,914 --> 00:49:08,984
I like that.

1393
00:49:09,844 --> 00:49:11,183
