1394
00:49:11,184 --> 00:49:12,484
- Good. - Okay.

1395
00:49:12,654 --> 00:49:14,554
- Rock-paper-scissors. - Rock-paper-scissors.

1396
00:49:14,954 --> 00:49:16,053
You'll push...

1397
00:49:16,054 --> 00:49:17,754
- Wait. Let's order more. - Exactly.

1398
00:49:19,454 --> 00:49:21,353
- They'll order more. - We wanted fried dumplings.

1399
00:49:21,354 --> 00:49:23,464
- Ma'am, we'll get fried dumplings. - Okay.

1400
00:49:23,694 --> 00:49:24,863
(The final match begins.)

1401
00:49:24,864 --> 00:49:27,263
- I can push more than one, right? - Yes, you can.

1402
00:49:27,264 --> 00:49:28,264
Okay.

1403
00:49:28,265 --> 00:49:29,564
Gosh. You're bold.

1404
00:49:30,364 --> 00:49:31,974
- Ma'am. - I can relax at first.

1405
00:49:32,104 --> 00:49:34,033
(1 tooth, 2 teeth)

1406
00:49:34,034 --> 00:49:35,474
What?

1407
00:49:35,674 --> 00:49:36,944
Hold on. I'm going to push one more tooth.

1408
00:49:38,544 --> 00:49:39,614
(One more)

1409
00:49:39,714 --> 00:49:41,114
(Interesting)

1410
00:49:41,914 --> 00:49:43,114
(1 tooth)

1411
00:49:44,414 --> 00:49:46,453
(Should I go for one more?)

1412
00:49:46,454 --> 00:49:47,614
No, I'll stop here.

1413
00:49:48,454 --> 00:49:50,784
That's enough for now.

1414
00:49:51,224 --> 00:49:53,123
- Push one more. - No, that was enough.

1415
00:49:53,124 --> 00:49:55,094
- Come on. Go for one more. - No, that was enough.

1416
00:49:55,464 --> 00:49:57,194
- That was... - That was enough. Yes.

1417
00:49:58,464 --> 00:49:59,664
(Thinking)

1418
00:50:00,064 --> 00:50:01,134
Okay.

1419
00:50:02,564 --> 00:50:04,604
(Yeon Seok has to pay.)

1420
00:50:04,764 --> 00:50:05,873
Okay.

1421
00:50:05,874 --> 00:50:07,104
