1430
00:50:26,294 --> 00:50:27,754
- Thank you. - Gosh. They're served at once.

1431
00:50:28,154 --> 00:50:30,164
Gosh. It looks tasty.

1432
00:50:31,624 --> 00:50:34,094
- Guess which is jjajang noodles. - This one.

1433
00:50:34,794 --> 00:50:36,234
- Right. It's steamy. - It was obvious.

1434
00:50:37,834 --> 00:50:40,134
- It was the steamy one. - This one had to be the one.

1435
00:50:40,304 --> 00:50:43,344
I crave cold kimchi noodles in summer.

1436
00:50:43,904 --> 00:50:45,513
Thanks for the food. Please enjoy.

1437
00:50:45,514 --> 00:50:47,744
Please enjoy. Thanks for the food.

1438
00:50:48,274 --> 00:50:50,044
Gosh. Look at this rabokki.

1439
00:50:51,854 --> 00:50:54,783
- It's been a while since I had it. - You can't take all the noodles.

1440
00:50:54,784 --> 00:50:56,883
I'll take this much. I grabbed too much.

1441
00:50:56,884 --> 00:50:58,353
- That's not fair. - Jae Seok.

1442
00:50:58,354 --> 00:50:59,523
We only have one rabokki.

1443
00:50:59,524 --> 00:51:01,964
I was going to shake some off, but it didn't work.

1444
00:51:03,224 --> 00:51:05,263
(Taking a fair amount)

1445
00:51:05,264 --> 00:51:06,364
I'll have the dumplings first.

1446
00:51:07,194 --> 00:51:08,634
I need to taste this first.

1447
00:51:08,704 --> 00:51:09,704
(Satisfied)

1448
00:51:13,004 --> 00:51:14,204
Gosh.

1449
00:51:14,504 --> 00:51:15,674
It's tasty.

1450
00:51:16,744 --> 00:51:17,974
- Is the sauce different? - Yes.

1451
00:51:18,514 --> 00:51:20,844
(Jung Min tries a bite of the pork cutlet first.)

1452
00:51:21,474 --> 00:51:22,743
- It's tasty. - Hey.

1453
00:51:22,744 --> 00:51:24,314
The pork cutlet is so good.

1454
00:51:24,414 --> 00:51:25,514
Is it?

1455
00:51:25,654 --> 00:51:28,114
I think she made the sauce herself.

1456
00:51:28,354 --> 00:51:29,784
Gosh. You and the sauce.

1457
00:51:30,324 --> 00:51:31,424
He's into the sauce again.

1458
00:51:32,754 --> 00:51:33,854
He's Hwang Sauce.

1459
00:51:34,724 --> 00:51:35,923
- Is the sauce different? - Yes.

1460
00:51:35,924 --> 00:51:38,264
- I think she made it from scratch. - I see.

1461
00:51:38,764 --> 00:51:39,864
It's good.

1462
00:51:40,994 --> 00:51:42,333
(Surprised)

1463
00:51:42,334 --> 00:51:43,803
- Right? - It's sweet.

1464
00:51:43,804 --> 00:51:45,374
(It's been a while since they had the snack near a school)

1465
00:51:46,574 --> 00:51:49,004
(At that moment,)

1466
00:51:49,944 --> 00:51:52,214
(someone quietly starts digging in.)

1467
00:51:52,374 --> 00:51:54,474
(Noodle Jung)

1468
00:51:55,114 --> 00:51:56,244
At golf clubs...

1469
00:51:58,244 --> 00:52:01,484
(She only targets the noodles.)

1470
00:52:06,494 --> 00:52:07,694
- Gosh. It's good. - I'm full.

1471
00:52:08,194 --> 00:52:09,693
- I'm done. - I know.

1472
00:52:09,694 --> 00:52:11,124
(While the others start to put their chopsticks down,)

1473
00:52:11,424 --> 00:52:13,563
