1477
00:52:19,904 --> 00:52:21,304
Once you're into noodles...

1478
00:52:22,274 --> 00:52:23,444
Gosh. It was tasty.

1479
00:52:23,674 --> 00:52:25,144
Ho Yeon is a noodle-lover too.

1480
00:52:25,514 --> 00:52:27,044
Gosh. I loved it.

1481
00:52:27,344 --> 00:52:28,783
It's been a while to have these street snacks.

1482
00:52:28,784 --> 00:52:30,113
- I'll pay now. - Okay.

1483
00:52:30,114 --> 00:52:31,444
I loved the food.

1484
00:52:31,744 --> 00:52:33,784
- Thank you for the food. - Thank you, ma'am.

1485
00:52:34,184 --> 00:52:35,953
We need to wait five minutes.

1486
00:52:35,954 --> 00:52:36,954
