1487
00:52:37,354 --> 00:52:39,194
You'll start greeting the audience in theaters.

1488
00:52:39,524 --> 00:52:41,324
I'll do that starting tomorrow.

1489
00:52:42,324 --> 00:52:45,394
For example, we also need to greet...

1490
00:52:45,864 --> 00:52:47,093
our viewers.

1491
00:52:47,094 --> 00:52:49,203
Today, we're in Jungnang-gu.

1492
00:52:49,204 --> 00:52:51,564
We go and see the viewers in each household.

1493
00:52:51,804 --> 00:52:52,934
"Nice to meet you."

1494
00:52:53,174 --> 00:52:54,573
"Thanks for watching."

1495
00:52:54,574 --> 00:52:56,243
