1496
00:52:56,244 --> 00:52:58,143
- Did you just do a stage greeting? - Yes, I did.

1497
00:52:58,144 --> 00:52:59,474
- This is a stage, then. - Yes.

1498
00:52:59,714 --> 00:53:00,873
We have a stage.

1499
00:53:00,874 --> 00:53:02,843
