1506
00:53:14,954 --> 00:53:16,824
Please tell us about your roles.

1507
00:53:16,964 --> 00:53:19,134
I played Beom Seok, a police station chief.

1508
00:53:19,864 --> 00:53:21,134
- Thank you. - Okay.

1509
00:53:21,294 --> 00:53:24,464
I'm Jung Ho Yeon, and I play Officer Lim Sung Ae.

1510
00:53:24,734 --> 00:53:26,404
- Gosh. Our cab is here. - Yes.

1511
00:53:26,774 --> 00:53:28,134
- You can hop in. - Okay.

1512
00:53:28,274 --> 00:53:30,004
We'll move to the next stage.

1513
00:53:31,044 --> 00:53:32,473
- Thanks. - Hello.

1514
00:53:32,474 --> 00:53:34,243
- I'll sit in the back. - Gosh. It's nice and cold.

1515
00:53:34,244 --> 00:53:35,483
Goodness.

1516
00:53:35,484 --> 00:53:37,043
- I think this is it. - Yes, it was here.

1517
00:53:37,044 --> 00:53:38,513
- You found this one, right? - Yes.

1518
00:53:38,514 --> 00:53:39,913
- Isn't this place cute? - It's cute.

1519
00:53:39,914 --> 00:53:42,283
- It's cute, right? - There's more space inside.

1520
00:53:42,284 --> 00:53:43,524
Hello.

1521
00:53:43,754 --> 00:53:45,423
Jung Min, get some.

1522
00:53:45,424 --> 00:53:46,654
(They'll drink some coffee because they have 20 minutes.)

1523
00:53:47,194 --> 00:53:48,664
Let's play a game for this one too.

1524
00:53:48,994 --> 00:53:50,023
(Game)

1525
00:53:50,024 --> 00:53:51,024
- A game? - Yes.

1526
00:53:51,025 --> 00:53:54,163
- Gosh. You're addicted to games. - Can't we play a game for this?

1527
00:53:54,164 --> 00:53:55,463
- Sure. - But for this one...

1528
00:53:55,464 --> 00:53:57,404
(Game)

1529
00:53:58,134 --> 00:53:59,703
- Let's play Pick a Card. - Pick a Card?

1530
00:53:59,704 --> 00:54:01,703
- Pick a Card. - We have to hide our cards.

1531
00:54:01,704 --> 00:54:03,574
- But I don't have a credit card. - What is Pick a Card?

1532
00:54:03,944 --> 00:54:05,373
- I pay with my phone too. - Really?

1533
00:54:05,374 --> 00:54:06,814
- In that case... - Since we are the same...

1534
00:54:06,944 --> 00:54:09,184
Then we can mix these up like this.

1535
00:54:09,544 --> 00:54:11,244
