00:54:31,834 --> 00:54:33,404
Smoothies will take a while, right?

1548
00:54:35,234 --> 00:54:37,273
- Ten minutes? - No, it'll be done quickly.

1549
00:54:37,274 --> 00:54:39,273
- Is that so? - Yes. We don't have many customers.

1550
00:54:39,274 --> 00:54:42,014
