I sprinkle some sugar and toss the potatoes.

1702
01:00:05,064 --> 01:00:07,403
I put them in a pot, cover it with a lid, and toss them.

1703
01:00:07,404 --> 01:00:09,343
I add sugar again for those potatoes inside.

1704
01:00:09,344 --> 01:00:11,043
I give it a toss again.

1705
01:00:11,044 --> 01:00:12,973
