1706
01:00:12,974 --> 01:00:14,314
Yes, that's the way to go.

1707
01:00:14,414 --> 01:00:16,944
- It's so good. - You're an unusual cook.

1708
01:00:18,914 --> 01:00:19,914
Seriously.

1709
