1732
01:01:07,864 --> 01:01:09,064
What is this conversation?

1733
01:01:09,234 --> 01:01:10,663
In the beginning,

1734
01:01:10,664 --> 01:01:12,733
- when I first studied Hangul, - When I watched it...

1735
01:01:12,734 --> 01:01:14,203
- they said, "Grandma," - Yes.

1736
01:01:14,204 --> 01:01:16,373
