1756
01:02:00,184 --> 01:02:02,083
- They won't even respond. - But our teachers here...

1757
01:02:02,084 --> 01:02:03,923
- All kids are like that. - Yes.

1758
01:02:03,924 --> 01:02:05,283
Gosh. He knows.

1759
01:02:05,284 --> 01:02:06,623
