1764
01:02:14,634 --> 01:02:16,133
- Not your kids. - Never your kids.

1765
01:02:16,134 --> 01:02:17,663
- It can't be your husband either. - That's true.

1766
01:02:17,664 --> 01:02:19,603
- You're right about it. - I love this school so much.

1767
01:02:19,604 --> 01:02:20,833
- You're right. - Yes.

1768
01:02:20,834 --> 01:02:23,943
